     2957   ON CHOOSE OF B-allmark IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2958   DO:
     2959     for each temp-conn: delete temp-conn . end.
     2960     assign mark-num = 0 .
     2961     GET FIRST spec-List NO-LOCK .
     2962     DO WHILE AVAILABLE(buf_contract-specif):
     2963       create temp-conn .
     2964       assign
     2965         temp-conn.ri = recid( buf_contract-specif )
     2966         mark-num = mark-num + 1
     2967       .
     2968       GET next spec-List NO-LOCK .
     2969     end.
     2970     if mark-num = 0 then hide    mark-num in frame Dialog-Frame.
     2971     else                 display mark-num  with frame Dialog-Frame.
     2972     RUN OpenBr(yes, no, '':U) .
     2973   END.
